<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/24/eng@/~cl_1> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act may be cited as the Lembaga Kemajuan Wilayah Pulau Pinang (Amendment) Act 1996."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/24/eng@> .
